{"chars": "Then she did what she always does when she meets a new flower. She didn't hurry. She took out her magnifying glass and looked, slowly and carefully, at every part. She counted the petals. She looked at the frilly edge of the lip, and the tiny spots, and the way the little cone-shaped bulb sat in the moss. She leaned in close and sniffed, and she touched the moss around it, very gently, with one fingertip, to feel how wet it was.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.45, 0.45, 0.45, 0.45, 0.575, 0.575, 0.575, 0.575, 0.762, 0.762, 0.762, 0.762, 0.762, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 1.025, 1.025, 1.025, 1.025, 1.025, 1.025, 1.025, 1.35, 1.35, 1.35, 1.35, 1.35, 1.663, 1.663, 1.663, 1.663, 1.663, 1.8, 1.8, 1.8, 1.8, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 2.212, 2.212, 2.3, 2.3, 2.3, 2.3, 2.538, 2.538, 2.538, 2.538, 2.538, 2.538, 2.538, 3.275, 3.375, 3.375, 3.375, 3.375, 3.513, 3.513, 3.513, 3.513, 3.513, 3.513, 3.513, 3.725, 3.725, 3.725, 3.725, 3.725, 3.725, 4.325, 4.425, 4.425, 4.425, 4.425, 4.575, 4.575, 4.575, 4.575, 4.575, 4.763, 4.763, 4.763, 4.763, 4.938, 4.938, 4.938, 4.938, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.725, 5.725, 5.725, 5.725, 5.725, 5.725, 6.2, 6.2, 6.2, 6.2, 6.325, 6.325, 6.325, 6.325, 6.325, 6.325, 6.325, 6.675, 6.787, 6.787, 6.787, 6.787, 6.787, 6.787, 6.787, 7.225, 7.225, 7.225, 7.225, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.85, 7.925, 7.925, 7.925, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.363, 8.363, 8.363, 8.363, 8.363, 9.075, 9.188, 9.188, 9.188, 9.188, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.713, 9.713, 9.713, 9.713, 9.8, 9.8, 9.8, 9.8, 9.8, 9.8, 9.8, 10.625, 10.738, 10.738, 10.738, 10.738, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 11.113, 11.113, 11.113, 11.188, 11.188, 11.188, 11.188, 11.312, 11.312, 11.312, 11.312, 11.312, 11.312, 11.312, 11.65, 11.65, 11.65, 11.65, 11.65, 11.863, 11.863, 11.863, 11.938, 11.938, 11.938, 11.938, 12.05, 12.05, 12.05, 12.05, 12.5, 12.6, 12